{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>KungFuBack 是一款懷舊風格的橫版動作過關遊戲，玩家將扮演武術高手穿越五個充滿挑戰的關卡，擊敗各路幫派並拯救心愛之人。這款 App 目前正進行限時免費活動，原價為 US $0.99，喜歡經典街机風格的玩家不容錯過。</p>\n\n<h2>復古戰鬥與多平台支援</h2>\n<p>遊戲提供流暢的拳腳連擊與精準打擊感，畫面採用忠於經典的復古像素風格。操作方面同時支援螢幕虛擬按鍵與 MFI 遊戲手柄，讓手機或平板用戶都能享受順暢體驗。五個獨立關卡從市中心街道到幫派巢穴，場景變化豐富且難度遞增，每個瞬間都充滿緊張刺激的格鬥樂趣，適合追求純粹動作快感的玩家。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2868x1320bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2868x1320bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2868x1320bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2868x1320bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2868x1320bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2868x1320bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：KungFuBack</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T08:24:11.611620+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":310,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}